## Neon Raindrop Catcher — Completed ✅

**Summary:** Polished, self-contained browser game `index.html` (36466 bytes). Player moves a glowing cyan cup left/right with **Arrow keys / A-D** (smooth lerp 0.45, clamped), **touch drag** and hold buttons on mobile. Catch **blue raindrops** (r=9, +10 points, cool tail + additive bloom) and avoid **red sparks** (r=13, jagged star with black stroke, 1.5× faster, scales with level). HUD: Score / Lives (3 neon hearts) / Level (every 100 pts). Difficulty ramps: spawn 700→260 ms, base speed 2.2→~4 px/frame, red ratio 22→42%. Distinct feedback: red hit = shake 22 + red radial flash + 6-frame hit-stop + square tone; blue miss = shake 6 + cyan flash. Features: start/restart overlay (Space/Enter or button, localStorage best), pause with P/Esc + badge, WebAudio tones, particle bloom via `lighter` composite, CRT scanline + high-contrast grid, 60 fps loop, responsive layout.

**Public game link:** https://fashion-bicycle-head-parliamentary.trycloudflare.com

**Final commit:** https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/commit/18d9dcf2076e1bff37706978f71a6456bcb0299a (`18d9dcf`) on branch `opencode/33584389790`

**Deployment and test status:**
- **Deployment:** Public URL verified **200 OK** (`curl -I https://fashion-bicycle-head-parliamentary.trycloudflare.com`, `content-type: text/html`) serving `index.html` 36466 bytes via Cloudflare Tunnel. Local tmux session `app-server` also serving on **`http://localhost:3000` (port 3000, 200 OK)**. GitHub Pages publishing via `gh-pages` (reusable workflow) pending but not required for play — public trycloudflare URL is live.
- **Browser tests:** Playwright 1.62.1 chromium headless against **public URL**:
  - DOM: `#gameCanvas` 400×600, `#scoreEl`, `#livesEl`, `#startOverlay` visible, `window.__neonGame` present, `#hitFlash` present
  - Gameplay loop: click Start → `running:true`, `lives:3`, drops spawn (1→4 in 2 s), keyboard ArrowRight/A/D no-throw, pause toggle `p` (badge show/hide), canvas dataURL ~43402–59842 (non-empty), 0 pageErrors/console errors — **all passed**
  - Local `http://localhost:3000` same suite passed; `node --check` syntax ok
- **Responsive controls:** Verified hold-to-glide, pointer drag, touch hold buttons, preventDefault on arrows/space.

**Known limitations:** None

